    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin allows you to replace WooCommerce default button texts easily:<br />\n&#8211; Buy Now<br />\n&#8211; Choose Options<br />\n&#8211; View Cart<br />\n&#8211; Update Cart<br />\n&#8211; Proceed to Checkout<br />\n&#8211; Place Order<br />\n&#8211; Apply Coupon</p>\n<p>Settings are added under WooCommerce &gt; Change WC Texts.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce &gt; Change WC Texts to configure your custom labels.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Customize WooCommerce button and label texts like “Buy”, “View cart”, “Apply coupon”, “Checkout” directly from the admin panel.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin allows you to replace WooCommerce default button texts easily:<br />\n&#8211; Buy Now<br />\n&#8211; Choose Options<br />\n&#8211; View Cart<br />\n&#8211; Update Cart<br />\n&#8211; Proceed to Checkout<br />\n&#8211; Place Order<br />\n&#8211; Apply Coupon</p>\n<p>Settings are added under WooCommerce &gt; Change WC Texts.</p>\n",
